        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who am I? To find the answer, talk to people, learn words, and unlock new conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Am I: Error Code 99</strong> is an action novel game where you save memories and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To know yourself, talk to others.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the icons displayed on the map to converse with people.<br>Someone out there might know who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/91f31f18ba583fe46f10c642226e2d96.poster.avif?t=1759157985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/91f31f18ba583fe46f10c642226e2d96.webm?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/91f31f18ba583fe46f10c642226e2d96.mp4?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn words and discover new conversations.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save words that appear in conversations and try talking to other people.<br>You might receive a different answer this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/4974b562bb8bd55a46fcd3e02c1125c2.poster.avif?t=1759157985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/4974b562bb8bd55a46fcd3e02c1125c2.webm?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/4974b562bb8bd55a46fcd3e02c1125c2.mp4?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can remember up to three words.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the necessary words carefully.<br>Because of your injuries, you can't remember too many words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's beyond the conversations...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is distorted.<br>To regain your memories, you might face great suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for that?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who am I? To find the answer, talk to people, learn words, and unlock new conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Am I: Error Code 99</strong> is an action novel game where you save memories and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To know yourself, talk to others.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the icons displayed on the map to converse with people.<br>Someone out there might know who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/91f31f18ba583fe46f10c642226e2d96.poster.avif?t=1759157985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/91f31f18ba583fe46f10c642226e2d96.webm?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/91f31f18ba583fe46f10c642226e2d96.mp4?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn words and discover new conversations.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save words that appear in conversations and try talking to other people.<br>You might receive a different answer this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/4974b562bb8bd55a46fcd3e02c1125c2.poster.avif?t=1759157985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/4974b562bb8bd55a46fcd3e02c1125c2.webm?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/4974b562bb8bd55a46fcd3e02c1125c2.mp4?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can remember up to three words.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the necessary words carefully.<br>Because of your injuries, you can't remember too many words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's beyond the conversations...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is distorted.<br>To regain your memories, you might face great suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for that?</p>",
